<div>Dear Mr. Kim,</div>
<font face=3D""></font></div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>Yours noted. As far as self knows, there is no change in visa on arriv=
al, however will check on saturday after opening of local offices(after cur=
rent religious holidays).
</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>However, if there is time gap available, would suggest to take Visit V=
isa from Iranian Consulate(in Korea)&nbsp;before commence&nbsp;of travel fr=
om Korea,&nbsp;to avoid any inconvenience/disturbance&nbsp;at Tehran Airpor=
t as it makes certian arrangement/confirmation in hand,&nbsp;with&nbsp;visa
 stamped on traveller passport before start of travelling to Iran, as well =
as cost is much cheaper than visa on arrival.</div>
<div><font face=3D""></font>&nbsp;</div>
<div><font face=3D"">In any case, we can arrange to issue Invitation Letter=
 from our Company, and Hotel Reservation/Confirmation, which can facilitate=
 in getting visa at Korea for traveller.</font></div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>Kindly arrange to provide tentative itinerary details/passport copy/ti=
cket copy&nbsp;for making required arrangments and update you accordingly.&=
nbsp;</div>
<div><font face=3D""></font>&nbsp;</div>
<div><font face=3D"">Best Regards,</font></div>
<div><font face=3D"">Ashar Iqbal</font></div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
